  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "都市與區域計畫法令與制度專論",
    "sub_ename": "SEMINAR ON URBAN AND REGIONAL PLANNING LAWS AND SYSTEM",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將以探討目前台灣施行之都市與區域計畫制度，及執行該制度所依據之相關法令為主，國外施行之都市與區域計畫制度則為課堂討論之參考資料。希望藉由此課程，同學們能深入瞭解都市與區域計畫制度在都市與區域發展扮演之角色、目前面臨之問題與課題、以及探討可行改善方向。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed for graduate students to understand the legal aspects and institutions of Taiwan's urban and regional planning system. Special attention is given to the role of urban and regional planning regulations and judicial rulings for urban and regional development and the issues to be faced in the future.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
